OL,3,GNEWSADriver guilty of man's death in
OL,4,Agrass cutting row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmanslaughter after he hit and killed
OL,8,Fanother man during a dispute about
OL,9,Fcutting grass.
OL,11,FMark Wigley, 60, ran down 45-year-old
OL,12,FLiam Green in a VW Touareg on Rose Tree
OL,13,FAvenue in Cudworth, near Barnsley, at
OL,14,Fabout 17:00 BST on 3 April.
OL,16,FFollowing a trial at Sheffield Crown
OL,17,FCourt, he was cleared of murder while
OL,18,Fhis daughter, Sarah Wigley, 39, and
OL,19,Fbrother-in-law, Neil Shaw, 54, were
OL,20,Fcleared of all charges.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
