OL,3,GNEWSADriver guilty of man's death in
OL,4,Agrass cutting row
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Graham Reeds KC said Mark Wigley,
OL,7,Fof Royston Road, Cudworth, had been
OL,8,Fconvicted on "abundant and clear
OL,9,Fevidence" and would be sentenced on
OL,10,FThursday.
